      "filename": "Abbassiya march on July 23 2011.jpg",
      "title": "File:Abbassiya march on July 23 2011.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/Abbassiya_march_on_July_23_2011.jpg",
